# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""v2 of the two newsletter copies:
 - inner 600px blocks made fluid below 640px (that is what still clipped on a phone)
 - H2 treatment now covers every real section heading: size >= 20px, weight >= 800, dark colour, >= 12 chars of text
   (so hero statements on dark, stats like '2003' and kickers are left alone)."""
